/*
 * Rain-activated window controller for Raspberry Pi 5.
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - Seeed Studio Rain Sensor v1.0  DO  -> GPIO17 (BCM), 3.3 V logic, pull-up enabled
 *   - L298N driver
